# Title: User Discovery And Export Via Get-ADUser Cmdlet
# ID: 1114e048-b69c-4f41-bc20-657245ae6e3f
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-09
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1033
# Description: Detects usage of the Get-ADUser cmdlet to collect user information and output it to a file
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*Get-ADUser * AND process.command_line:* -Filter \\**) AND (process.command_line:* > * OR process.command_line:* | Select * OR process.command_line:*Out-File* OR process.command_line:*Set-Content* OR process.command_line:*Add-Content*)) AND (((process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:"PowerShell.EXE" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"pwsh.dll"))))
